:INFO
Art. 1 Subject matter
This Act regulates the levying of the charge for using National Highways ("the charge").
|

:INFO
Art. 2 Scope of application
The charge is levied for using primary and secondary national highways (Class I and II national highways) in accordance with the Network Decree of 10 December 2012.
|

:NOTE
Art. 2 — Amended by No I of the FA of 18 Dec. 2020, in force since 1 Aug. 2023 (AS 2023 337; BBl 2019 5889).
BBl 2017 7807

